Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:03.79,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Nikola Bartunkova gets it done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N尼古拉 巴尔通科娃赢下了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.31,0:00:08.61,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The number two seed, the number two player in the world, is out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第二 二号种子出局了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:12.36,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}次反扑机会 萨巴伦卡都没能把握
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.37,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}4{\fs68}号上午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:17.73,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}中网女单第三轮 她两盘出局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:22.39,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}此前在柏林 她曾先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:24.50,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}再逆转巴尔通科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:26.96,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}这次 开局发球局失守
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:29.81,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}官方集锦从{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:32.58,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}先守住自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:35.03,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}她才有机会继续追赶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.79,0:00:40.57,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Big put-away from Sabalenka there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N萨巴伦卡这一拍大力终结
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.28,0:00:45.39,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 她把对手逼到平分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:46.96,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}底线连续对拉后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:49.88,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}萨巴伦卡再次拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:00:59.44,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Much better from Sabalenka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N萨巴伦卡这一分打得好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:01.55,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}但这局{\fs78}5{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:03.31,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}她一个也没兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:06.05,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}官方集锦未收录完整过程
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:08.71,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}对手保发 {\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:15.16,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Couple break opportunities for a double break for Bartunkova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N巴尔通科娃两个破发点 有望再破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:23.28,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Saves one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N挽救了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:29.81,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}错过追平 她自己的发球局又受压
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.81,0:01:32.49,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}萨巴伦卡连续救回两个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.49,0:01:33.85,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}继续争
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:45.01,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}这一局 她一共救回{\fs78}3{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.01,0:01:46.83,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}保发追到{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.83,0:01:49.91,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}第三次救分 集锦没有收录
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.38,0:01:54.35,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}首盘盘点 看看这记发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.58,0:01:59.52,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A great serve from Bartunkova. Served well throughout the opening set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N巴尔通科娃好发球 首盘发得出色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:02.61,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 首盘没追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.61,0:02:03.90,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}次盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.90,0:02:06.43,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}她又被破发 落后{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.43,0:02:08.31,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}这次破发的完整过程
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.31,0:02:10.61,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}官方集锦未收录
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:13.76,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}从底线冲到网前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:17.07,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}她把低球救起 延续这场反扑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:24.49,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, nice pickup from Sabalenka there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦 萨巴伦卡这记低球救得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:30.06,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}但这一盘 她没拿到任何破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:32.16,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 再丢这个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:34.05,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}比赛就结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:43.61,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Nikola Bartunkova gets it done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N尼古拉 巴尔通科娃赢下了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.13,0:02:48.43,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The number two seed, the number two player in the world, is out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第二 二号种子出局了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:52.73,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Nikola Bartunkova, the biggest win of her career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N巴尔通科娃生涯最重要的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:57.86,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What an impressive showing from this young 20-year-old.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}20{\fs68}岁小将的表现令人赞叹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:03:00.24,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's vaulted up the rankings this year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她今年的排名飞速上升
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:07.06,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Started the year in the 130s and now 34 and moving on up,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N年初{\fs78}130{\fs68}多位 如今{\fs78}34{\fs68}位\N排名还将继续攀升
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.06,0:03:15.12,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as Nikola Bartunkova takes out Aryna Sabalenka in straight sets, 6-4, 6-3.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N巴尔通科娃{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}\N直落两盘淘汰萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:17.44,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}次机会没有兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:19.48,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}期待萨巴伦卡调整回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:22.48,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}下次能把关键机会握住吗？
